abstract: "Exact sparse interval certificate producers and separate checkers, continuous conversion, regularity diagnostics and reproducibility materials. Distribution 1.1.0 adds validated-envelope, synthesis and implicit-DAG modules plus a source-reconstruction route for RouterBench. Original code is BSD-3-Clause; original non-code material is CC BY 4.0. Third-party rights remain component-specific."
